    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Introduction to the game: </h2><strong>Cold movement, endless reincarnation...... /b]<br>Only fighting to the end of the world to return to our hometown!<br><br>One of the rules of movement:<br>Reincarnationer must complete the main task given by the movement.<br><br>Rule 2 of the movement:<br>Reincarnationer is not allowed to disclose information about the movement to any plot characters.<br><br>Rule 3 of the movement:<br>When the Reincarnationer meets the conditions, they are allowed to return to their hometown.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to play the game: </h2>Players will operate through the mouse or keyboard, take risks in different styles of the world, complete the task of sleepless movement, and get rich rewards!<br>There are synthetic systems and multiple currency systems. Because every world has a different currency!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game features: </h2>Every scene is a double story! Every NPC can interact (kill)! Every world can start all over again! This is infinite flow!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Author's words: </h2>The work of independent producer! Game content is still expanding! Any comments are welcome! Welcome to group communication! QQ Group number: 947128515</strong>",
